{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Debra’s Kitchen》是一款專為不想依賴網絡的家庭煮食者、露營人士及經常身處網絡不穩定環境的人而設的離線食譜 App，現正限時免費，原價為 US $0.99。食譜直接儲存於裝置內，不需帳戶、登入或雲端服務，開啟後即可快速查看。</p>\n\n<h2>離線食譜與購物清單</h2>\n<p>Debra’s Kitchen 支援儲存及整理最多 1,000 份個人食譜，無論在家中、小屋、船上或其他沒有穩定網絡的地方，都能即時取用，毋須等待載入。內置購物清單工具可從食譜建立清單，並透過清單下方的視覺化選單加入項目，減少上下捲動；所有資料只保留在裝置內，方便妥善保存個人及家傳食譜。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-59-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-60-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-61-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-62-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-63-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-64-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Debra’s Kitchen</li>\n<li>應用類別：Food &amp; Drink</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T23:20:51.035744+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":328,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}